{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "m6-bake-oven",
  "title": "Bake oven",
  "description": "An oven that must bake for 8 s in all. Opening the door pauses the heat; when it is shut again, baking carries on where it left off. A Bake switch, the door switch, a Clear button, the heater and a Done light.",
